summary:
  Today's radiology news highlights advancements in AI for faster and more accurate image analysis, particularly in brain imaging.  Several research studies explore the link between lifestyle factors like diet and hearing aid use with long-term health outcomes, including stroke and dementia risk.

top_stories[8]{title,source,url,category,importance,ai_summary}:
