  Source: Google News Radiology
  URL: https://news.google.?oc=5
  Category: news
  importance: 95
  ai_summary: "Despite advancements, radiology remains a field requiring human expertise and judgment, as demonstrated by the challenges AI faces in fully replacing clinicians."
  
