  Title: New brain scan findings find a clue to human brain evolution in finger length
  Source: ScienceDaily
  URL: https://www.sciencedaily.com/releases/2026/02/260210040559.htm
  Category: research
  importance: 92
  ai_summary: "Prenatal hormone exposure, indicated by finger length ratios, may have significantly influenced brain size development in human evolution, offering new insights into cognitive changes."
  
  Title: AI reads brain MRIs in seconds and flags emergencies
  Source: ScienceDaily
  URL: https://www.sciencedaily.com/releases/2026/02/260210005419.htm
  Category: research
  importance: 98
  ai_summary: "A novel AI system demonstrates rapid and highly accurate analysis of brain MRIs, with potential to expedite emergency care and improve diagnostic efficiency."
  
  Title: Hearing aids didn’t boost memory tests but dementia risk dropped
  Source: ScienceDaily
  URL: https://www.sciencedaily.com/releases/2026/02/260209064314.htm
  Category: research
  importance: 85
  ai_summary: "Long-term hearing aid use is linked to a reduced risk of dementia, despite not improving cognitive function in memory tests, highlighting a potential non-cognitive benefit."
  
  Title: This popular diet was linked to a much lower stroke risk
  Source: ScienceDaily
  URL: https://www.sciencedaily.com/releases/2026/02/260209064310.htm
  Category: research
  importance: 80
  ai_summary: "Adherence to a Mediterranean diet is associated with a significantly lower risk of stroke across various types, underscoring the importance of lifestyle in stroke prevention."
  
  Title: A secret cell alliance may explain why ovarian cancer is so deadly
  Source: ScienceDaily
  URL: https://www.sciencedaily.com/releases/2026/02/260209064254.htm
  Category: research
  importance: 78
  ai_summary: "Ovarian cancer's aggressive spread is attributed to a collaborative alliance between cancer cells and protective cells in the abdomen, suggesting a new target for therapeutic intervention."
  
